The adaptation is of the framework's signals and thresholds, expressed as
prose criteria in Spanish. No source code from `agentic-seo` is included in
this repository. Its scoring output is deliberately not used; see the
"Herramienta: `agentic-seo`" section of `accesibilidad-y-seo.md`.
